{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>צהר</b> in gematria is אור האבן (light of the stone): 267." "<b>ושלשים</b> — two times in the Masorah: here and the other ושלשים יסעו. Hint to the one who says the banners traveled in square formation. Another interpretation: by merit of the banners they were saved. תעשה — and I supported with 'and I' (ואני) to תעשה, to say that I will assist you in its making, for were it not so, he could not have made it."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:44.363592566Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}